Comments:
Evaluated by Caleb Marshall 2025
1) All C2S values and gamma widths from Herndl, with the exception of the 276.0 keV resonance. Values for 276.0 keV resonance taken from Longfellow 2018.
2) Energies were derived from a least squares fit of the energies reported in Longfellow 2018. The proposed doublet at 2380 keV and 2365 keV was condensed into
single state at 2371 keV due to lack of evidence for two states. Weighted average was taken with Benenson 1972.